== template_cost on hand-built templates ==
  reduction body, one instantiation            flops=5 bytes=20 exact
reduction: kernel flops = instantiation flops x projected extent: true
reduction: bytes are the operand's cells of one instantiation, self excluded: true
reduction: no index vector, no collapse: true
  where body, hoisted reduction arm            flops=6 bytes=24 exact
where: exact, 6 ops and 24 bytes per instantiation: true
  where body, arm the simplifier inlines (bound) flops=2 bytes=8 approx
where: a collapsible arm prices as the simplified, conditional form: true
  shared-loop body priced for S (sibling dropped) flops=1 bytes=4 exact
shared loop: the sibling's ops and reads do not price: true
  affine index position (loops kept, bound)    flops=4 bytes=16 approx
  bare iterator positions (collapsed, exact)   flops=1 bytes=4 exact
affine position: the loops stay and the count is a bound: true
bare positions: both loops collapse, exact: true
  packed-uniform producer (bound)              flops=4 bytes=4 approx
packed-uniform producer prices as a bound: true
  two alpha-equivalent scopes (CSE'd)          flops=6 bytes=20 exact
alpha-equivalent scope bodies price once: true
  diagonal producer (bound)                    flops=1 bytes=4 approx
a repeated bare symbol prices as a bound: true
== recompute_cost through optimize ==
chain: both links virtual: true
  x1 = x0 + w1                                 flops=1 bytes=8 exact
  x2 = sin(x1), x1 expanded                    flops=2 bytes=8 exact
chain: x2's recompute is transitive (2 ops, x0 and w1's cells): true
chain: a materialized leaf has no template cost: true
  flip candidates:
    materialize x2   cost 2 (modeled)
    materialize x1   cost 1 (modeled)
chain: x2's Materialize flip is priced by the model (2 ops x multiplicity 1, one reader): true
== ordering witness: proxy vs model ==
  a    proxy (extent x fan-in) 3  modeled 2
  b    proxy (extent x fan-in) 1  modeled 4
witness: the proxy ranks the wide sum above the deep chain: true
witness: the model ranks the deep chain above the wide sum: true
witness: executed values match the reference: true
== producer_cost on a materialized setter nest ==
producer: x1 and x2 inlined into x3's setter: true
  x3's setter nest, per cell                   flops=3 bytes=16 exact
producer: three adds and four leaf cells per written cell: true
producer: a node the code never sets has no producer cost: true
  two-component producer, per read             flops=2 bytes=8 exact
two-component producer: components sum (2 ops, 8 bytes per read): true
a setter reading a hoisted local it does not define prices as a bound: true
  broadcast operands, per read                 flops=1 bytes=8 exact
broadcast operands: one add and both cells per read, exact: true
